### Listar todos os usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdm}}

### Buscar usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{id_user}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdm}}

### Adopter logado busca a si mesmo por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdopter}}

### Atualizar usuário
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{id_user}} 
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdm}}

{
    "name": "carlos",
    "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
    "phone": "549993231312"
}

### Adopter logado atualiza a si mesmo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdopter}}

{
    "name": "João Santos",
    "email": "joaoatualizado@gmail.com",
