### Atualizar usuário pra admin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{id_user}} 
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdm}}

{
    "name": "Administrador2",
    "email": "administrador2@gmail.com",
    "phone": "549993231311",
    "role": "admin"
}

### Deletar um usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{id_user}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdm}}

